From: nullarc build34 maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] radv: zero-initialize video capability query data

SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

Fail closed when the platform reports success without writing capability data.

diff --git a/src/amd/common/ac_video.c b/src/amd/common/ac_video.c
--- a/src/amd/common/ac_video.c
+++ b/src/amd/common/ac_video.c
@@ -678 +678 @@
-   } dec_cap[8], enc_cap[8];
+   } dec_cap[8] = {0}, enc_cap[8] = {0};
